<view class="page"><view class="title">我的车库</view><view class="subtitle">一车一本账，日常与远方都照顾好。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="spaced"><view wx:for="{{cars}}" wx:key="id" class="card {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}"><view class="row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select" role="button" aria-label="选择{{item.name}}"><view class="symbol">车</view><view class="row-main"><view class="row-title">{{item.name}} {{item.archived ? '· 已归档' : ''}}</view><view class="row-meta">{{item.typeName}} · {{item.mileage}} km</view><view class="row-meta" wx:if="{{item.model}}">{{item.model}}</view></view><text wx:if="{{item.selected}}" class="tag">当前</text></view><view class="actions"><button class="quiet" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">编辑档案</button><button class="quiet" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-archived="{{item.archived}}" bindtap="archive">{{item.archived ? '恢复车辆' : '归档车辆'}}</button></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!cars.length}}" class="empty"><view class="muted">从你的第一辆车开始。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="addVehicle">＋ 添加车辆</button><view class="footer-note">支持燃油、非插电混动、插混 / 增程和纯电车辆。当前版本为本机账本，不会自动上传或同步数据。</view></view>
